        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. Delete adjectives and adverbs. Many writers can't resist adding useless adjectives and adverbs. Try deleting every adverb and every adjective before a noun, and then restore only those that readers need to understand the passage. In this passage, which ones should be restored?",
